{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-b94a2787-fa0a-4775-aad1-7f1ffe4e0e68","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-98501fed36eb1281","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9015-ekh2gjsx/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9015-E002.md","content":"# Link registered model versions to the runs that produced them\n\n## Description\n\nRegistered model versions record a reference to the run (training or pipeline)\nthat produced them, stored and served by the Model Registry. This lineage link\nis what lets a comparison be opened starting from a registered model version,\nsupporting model promotion decisions with traceability back to the producing\nexperiment.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Define and store a run reference on registered model versions, using the\n  Model Registry's existing metadata extension point for structured metadata\n  on ModelVersion entities (custom properties) rather than a new schema\n  object.\n- Expose the run reference through the Model Registry REST API so Dashboard\n  surfaces and API consumers can read it.\n- Keep the link optional and backward compatible: registration without a run\n  reference remains fully supported.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Given a model version registered with knowledge of its producing run, the\n  run reference is stored on the model version and retrievable through the\n  Model Registry REST API.\n- Model versions created without a run reference continue to be created,\n  listed, served, and deployed without error, and existing model versions are\n  not migrated or altered.\n- The run reference round-trips through the documented API surface (written at\n  registration, read back unchanged).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-2 (P1, data side)** — registered model versions link back to the run\n  that produced them. The registry-UI entry point that consumes this link is\n  tracked separately within the Dashboard component.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35807,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b06abf3d2c8b643","agent_id":"ac7da890a996a8d3d","session_id":"baae94b6-b5f6-4a75-a782-f5328e436f6d","uuid":"8469808a-46c7-410e-b598-d8b415e99f16","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:22:34.580Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9015"}
