{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b21e817d930959a3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: 'Run comparison view: side-by-side parameters and metrics with diff highlighting'\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tai_signals:\n10\t  change_specificity: 0\n11\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n12\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n13\t  existing_foundation: 1\n14\t  open_questions: 1\n15\t  external_dependency: 1\n16\t  human_process_gates: 0\n17\t  repo_access: 1\n18\t  architecture_claims: 1\n19\timplementation_type: null\n20\tdependencies: []\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 6\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view: side-by-side parameters and metrics with diff highlighting\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tDelivers a run comparison capability in the Dashboard: users select two or more\n34\truns from the runs list and view their parameters and metrics side by side, and\n35\tfor two selected runs see which parameters and metrics changed (diff\n36\thighlighting). This gives data scientists in-platform visibility into what\n37\tdiffers between candidate training and pipeline runs, replacing the exported\n38\tspreadsheets described in the strategy's problem statement.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Multi-selection of two or more runs from the existing runs list in the\n43\t  Dashboard.\n44\t- A comparison view that renders the parameters and metrics of every selected\n45\t  run side by side.\n46\t- A diff presentation over the same comparison surface: for two selected runs,\n47\t  parameters and metrics whose values differ are highlighted.\n48\t- Coverage of both run kinds surfaced by the platform today (training runs and\n49\t  Data Science Pipelines runs), consumed through the Dashboard's existing\n50\t  interfaces to run data — no changes to Data Science Pipelines are in scope.\n51\t- Validation that pipeline-run parameters and metrics as served by the\n52\t  existing Data Science Pipelines surfaces are complete enough for a\n53\t  side-by-side comparison and diff (passive-component validation).\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Given the runs list, when a user selects two or more runs and invokes the\n58\t  compare action, a comparison view shows each selected run's parameters and\n59\t  metrics side by side.\n60\t- Given exactly two runs in the comparison view, parameters and metrics whose\n61\t  values differ between the two runs are highlighted so the user can see what\n62\t  changed.\n63\t- The comparison works for both training runs and Data Science Pipelines runs\n64\t  as surfaced by the existing runs list, without code changes outside the\n65\t  Dashboard; any gap in pipeline-run parameter/metric availability surfaced by\n66\t  this validation is reported back to the strategy rather than worked around\n67\t  in another component.\n68\t- Existing per-run pages (parameters and metrics of a single run) continue to\n69\t  function without regression.\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- **HLR-1 (P0)** — select two or more runs and view their parameters and\n74\t  metrics side by side in the Dashboard.\n75\t- **HLR-3 (P1, consolidated with HLR-1)** — the run \"diff\" view highlighting\n76\t  which parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs is a\n77\t  presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the same run data, so\n78\t  it is delivered by this epic rather than a separate one.\n79\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-96e551ad022eb1be","agent_id":"ac71caae19aa21601","session_id":"baae94b6-b5f6-4a75-a782-f5328e436f6d","uuid":"86d1f69a-e4a4-4121-89dc-541c22e8b78c","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:27:14.160Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b21e817d930959a3","permiss