{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f1c15e79938622d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E003\n3\ttitle: Open a run comparison from the Model Registry\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 0\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 6\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# Open a run comparison from the Model Registry\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tFrom a registered model version in the Dashboard's Model Registry UI, users\n36\tcan open the run comparison with the run that produced that model version\n37\tpre-selected, and then complete the selection to compare it against other\n38\truns. This connects model promotion decisions to the experiment evidence held\n39\tin run parameters and metrics.\n40\t\n41\t## Scope\n42\t\n43\t- An action on a registered model version page in the Model Registry UI (the\n44\t  registry section of the Dashboard) that opens the run comparison populated\n45\t  with the referenced run.\n46\t- Within the opened comparison, the user can add further runs to reach a\n47\t  multi-run side-by-side comparison, reusing the comparison view's existing\n48\t  selection behavior.\n49\t- Graceful handling of model versions that carry no run reference: the action\n50\t  is absent or disabled and the page is otherwise unaffected.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- Given a registered model version that carries a run reference, the Model\n55\t  Registry UI offers an action that opens the run comparison with that run\n56\t  pre-selected.\n57\t- Given a registered model version without a run reference, the page renders\n58\t  without error and offers no broken path to the comparison.\n59\t- From a comparison opened this way, the user can add additional runs and gets\n60\t  the same side-by-side parameters/metrics view and two-run diff highlighting\n61\t  as when starting from the runs list.\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\t- **HLR-2 (P1, UI side)** — \"so a comparison can be opened from the Model\n66\t  Registry\": this epic delivers the registry-UI entry point that consumes the\n67\t  run-reference metadata stored on model versions and opens the run\n68\t  comparison capability.\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-95ca27f7fab2aa18","agent_id":"a0841ba5fcd5eab4b","session_id":"baae94b6-b5f6-4a75-a782-f5328e436f6d","uuid":"c0ac2ae2-0e14-4f97-8978-c8cc2ae9be77","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:28:23.065Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f1c15e79938622d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
